    "name": "Radiant Garb Iris Rhizome",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">\"Radiant Garb\" is a&nbsp;Tall Bearded Iris (TB) that blooms mid-season.&nbsp;It was introduced in 2009 by Darnell and Greg Hester.&nbsp;The iris has a height of 38 inches (97 cm).&nbsp;The standards are dusty pink, and the style arms are also dusty pink with magenta.&nbsp;The falls are deep magenta-wine, and the beards are orange.&nbsp;It has a slight sweet fragrance.&nbsp;</span></p>",
